# UI Design

## Colour Scheme

Primary Colour: Blue (#2D6CDF)
Secondary Colour: Light Grey (#F5F5F5)
Background Colour: White (#FFFFFF)
Text Colour: Black (#000000)
Button Colour: Green (#4CAF50)

## UI Style

The UniSwap interface follows a clean and simple design to make the platform easy for students to use. The layout uses clear navigation menus and structured sections to help users browse and add listings easily.

The design uses consistent spacing and a minimal colour scheme to improve readability and usability.
